/-! # st-qbar: the bypass fold that drops `shimuraTaniyamaQbar` (demonstration, generated by `gen_bypass.py`)

`OpenAddedLeaves17S` is the next added bundle (`OpenAddedLeaves17` without `shimuraTaniyamaQbar`); the
generations 7..16 of the added bundle are copied without the field (suffix `S`), and every map on
`frontier`'s path that takes one of them is copied verbatim (suffix `_S`) with the forwarding line
`shimuraTaniyamaQbar := …` deleted; at the gen-7 → gen-6 step, `stQM` is `GapST.stQM_of …`. -/

set_option linter.all false

namespace HDec

set_option maxHeartbeats 1000000

namespace HSyn

open CategoryTheory AlgebraicGeometry Limits MonoidalCategory CartesianMonoidalCategory MonObj
open NumberField


